From: Manikanta Mylavarapu <quic_mmanikan@quicinc.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:34:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] remoteproc: qcom: provide secure WCSS PIL and platform bindings

Add new binding document for hexagon based WCSS secure PIL remoteproc.
IPQ5018, IPQ5332, IPQ5424 and IPQ9574 follow secure PIL remoteproc.

Add support to bring up hexagon based WCSS using secure PIL. All IPQxxxx
SoCs support secure Peripheral Image Loading (PIL).

Enable nodes required for q6 remoteproc bring up.

Merged from:
  0186-dt-bindings-remoteproc-qcom-document-hexagon-based-wcss-secure-pil.patch
  0188-remoteproc-qcom-add-hexagon-based-wcss-secure-pil-driver.patch
  0189-arm64-dts-qcom-ipq5018-add-nodes-to-bringup-q6.patch

